            <ArticleTitle>Analgesic issues in palliative care gastroesophageal reflux pain and chronic non-cancer pain management.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>87-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Brief literature reviews and commentary on gastroesophageal reflux disease associated pain management with rectal dosage forms and beliefs about use of opioids in non-cancer pain are presented. Relevant references including the model guidelines of the Federation of State Medical Boards of the United States on the use of opioids in non-cancer pain are cited.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
